Description: Stop setting GTK_THEME so the system colour scheme can be read
 wxWidgets only creates its org.freedesktop.portal.Settings proxy when
 GTK_THEME is absent, and that proxy is what reads the desktop
 light/dark preference inside a sandbox. Related to upstream issue
 #13778. Also removes about 3 seconds of startup time.
